A(('call', 'Boundaries to Remember',
   'The King names what was done and not done, and says it was done or not done unto Him, and nothing more. No identity for the nations, the sheep, the goats, my brethren or the least of these. No symbol carried in from another parable. Feeding, visiting and clothing are actions in the King’s words, not steps of salvation. The Body of Christ is none of the companies named. The lessons are principles of conduct, not a transfer of Kingdom identity to the Body.'))
